":"மதி","gloss":"optative suffix"}],"gloss":"please remove"},{"surface":"அத்தை","parts":[{"text":"அத்தை","lemma":"அத்தை","gloss":"expletive particle"}],"gloss":"indeed"},{"surface":"உள்ளிய","parts":[{"text":"உள்ளிய","lemma":"உள்ளு","gloss":"thought of"}],"gloss":"thought of"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"விருந்துகண்டு","parts":[{"text":"விருந்து","lemma":"விருந்து","gloss":"guest"},{"text":"கண்டு","lemma":"கண்","gloss":"having seen"}],"gloss":"having seen a guest"},{"surface":"ஒளிக்கும்","parts":[{"text":"ஒளிக்கும்","lemma":"ஒளி","gloss":"hiding"}],"gloss":"hiding"},{"surface":"திருந்தா","parts":[{"text":"திருந்து","lemma":"திருந்து","gloss":"perfect"},{"text":"ஆ","lemma":"ஆ","gloss":"not"}],"gloss":"imperfect"},{"surface":"வாழ்க்கைப்","parts":[{"text":"வாழ்க்கைப்","lemma":"வாழ்க்கை","gloss":"life"}],"gloss":"life"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"பொறிப்புணர்","parts":[{"text":"பொறி","lemma":"பொறி","gloss":"senses"},{"text":"புணர்","lemma":"புணர்","gloss":"joined"}],"gloss":"joined with senses"},{"surface":"உடம்பில்","parts":[{"text":"உடம்பு","lemma":"உடம்பு","gloss":"body"},{"text":"இல்","lemma":"இல்","gloss":"in"}],"gloss":"in the body"},{"surface":"தோன்றி","parts":[{"text":"தோன்று","lemma":"தோன்று","gloss":"appear"},{"text":"இ","lemma":"இ","gloss":"having"}],"gloss":"having appeared"},{"surface":"என்","parts":[{"text":"என்","lemma":"என்","gloss":"my"}],"gloss":"my"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"அறிவுகெட","parts":[{"text":"அறிவு","lemma":"அறிவு","gloss":"intellect"},{"text":"கெட","lemma":"கெடு","gloss":"to ruin"}],"gloss":"ruining my intellect"},{"surface":"நின்ற","parts":[{"text":"நின்ற","lemma":"நில்","gloss":"that stood"}],"gloss":"that stands"},{"surface":"நல்கூர்","parts":[{"text":"நல்கூர்","lemma":"நல்கூர்","gloss":"suffer poverty"}],"gloss":"poverty"},{"surface":"மையே","parts":[{"text":"மை","lemma":"மை","gloss":"suffix of abstract noun"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"indeed"}],"gloss":"indeed"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"267","parts":[{"text":"267","lemma":"267","gloss":"267"}],"gloss":"267"},{"surface":"268","parts":[{"text":"268","lemma":"268","gloss":"268"}],"gloss":"268"},{"surface":"கிடைத்தில","parts":[{"text":"கிடைத்தில","lemma":"கிடைத்தில","gloss":"not available"}],"gloss":"not available"}]}],"literal":"Even if the summer fails to bring the beneficial great rain, / drying up the mud of the tanks, / under the shade of the wide leaves of the hollow-stemmed water lily, / the male conch with a curved shell and a black face / enters for daytime mating with the young, tender conch / in the water-shining paddy fields of the country of the great victorious one, / Cenni of the strong horse and sky-touching tall umbrella, / who reached the assembly where noble scholars were present, / like the clamor of crying 'be my support!', / swiftly remove, please, / the imperfect life of hiding upon seeing a guest, / appearing in this body joined with senses, my / poverty that stands ruining my intellect! / [Lines 267 and 268 are not available]","translation":"Even if the summer fails to bring the beneficial great rain, drying up the mud of the tanks, the male conch with a curved shell and a black face enters for daytime mating with the young, tender conch under the shade of the wide leaves of the hollow-stemmed water lily, in the water-shining paddy fields of your country. O Cenni of the strong horse and sky-touching tall umbrella, who sits in the assembly of noble scholars! Like a loud cry of 'be my support!', please swiftly remove my poverty, which has appeared in this body of senses, ruining my intellect and forcing me to lead an imperfect life of hiding in shame whenever a guest arrives.","modern":"பயன் தரும் பெரிய மேகம் பெய்யாமல் மாறி, குளத்துச் சேறுகள் காய்கின்ற கோடைக் காலமாயினும், துளையுள்ள தண்டினையுடைய ஆம்பலின் அகன்ற இலையின் நிழலில், கதிர்களைக் கொண்ட ஓட்டினையும் கரிய முகத்தினையும் உடைய ஆண் சங்கு, இளமையான மெல்லிய பெண் சங்குடன் பகல் பொழுதில் கூடி மகிழும் நீர் நிறைந்த கழனிகளைக் கொண்ட நாட்டின் தலைவனும், வான் தொடும் நீண்ட குடையையும் வலிய குதிரையையும் உடைய சென்னியே! சான்றோர்கள் நிறைந்த அவையின்கண் வீற்றிருப்பவனே! 'எனக்கு ஆதரவாகுக' என்று முறையிடும் பூசலைப் போல, விருந்தினரைக் கண்டு ஒளிந்து கொள்ளும் திருந்தாத வாழ்க்கையைத் தந்து, ஐம்புலன்கள் பொருந்திய உடம்பில் தோன்றி, என் அறிவைக் கெடுத்து நிற்கும் வறுமையினை விரைந்து நீக்கியருள்வாயாக. (267, 268 ஆம் பாடல்கள் கிடைக்கவில்லை).","explanation":"The poet Peruṅkuṉṟūr Kiḻār addresses the Chola king Uruvappaḥṟēr Iḷañcēṭceṉṉi, praising his presence in the assembly of wise scholars. He describes the Chola land where, even during severe summer droughts when tanks dry up, the fields remain so fertile and watered that conches mate in the shade of water lilies. This rich landscape of the marutam tract contrasts sharply with the poet's own miserable state of poverty. The poet laments that his poverty is so severe that it ruins his intellect and forces him to hide in shame when guests arrive, as he cannot afford to feed them. He compares his desperate plea to the king to a loud cry for help ('be my support!') and begs the king to swiftly banish his poverty.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"}}